      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "When they had come to Jerusalem, they were received by the assembly and the apostles and the elders, and they reported everything that God had done with them.",
      "ko": "예루살렘에 이르러 교회와 사도와 장로들에게 영접을 받고 하나님이 자기들과 함께 계셔 행하신 모든 일을 말하매",
      "source_text_hash": "ec1244171a2e28c55fc25f415e1ee3d8be602c12c668635ea31e62c06354628f",
      "translation_text_hash": "98fb0022dfdc44946fded0c61ea1d578e5f5ed534156cdbade48c915e670b4e1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
