      "en": "He made no distinction between us and them, cleansing their hearts by faith.",
      "ko": "믿음으로 저희 마음을 깨끗이 하사 저희나 우리나 분간치 아니하셨느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5d06d79a3369dfb21756a3317216dbc3354840608f596cfa80f8572e66b702a1",
      "translation_text_hash": "f277a1a18ce75a1cbf8e1c92f02ed2ec3c9458b045efe7ac98443222ef0c4ce1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
