      "en": "After they were silent, James answered, “Brothers, listen to me.",
      "ko": "말을 마치매 야고보가 대답하여 가로되 형제들아 내 말을 들으라",
      "source_text_hash": "bfffdda5f4d7e31daa0c973fd9ad3bb074798c1f53b31b8213980200eba0c94f",
