      "en": "This agrees with the words of the prophets. As it is written,",
      "ko": "선지자들의 말씀이 이와 합하도다 기록된바",
      "source_text_hash": "eb9ecf990792bfe21f0a858bbe6e74458bbe488b4bb6390dbb617fbdce80ff58",
      "translation_text_hash": "48eaf53815b07a36edd461520e5bdef6eb91944adf4990a38425961f5b7e8961",
