      "en": "but that we write to them that they abstain from the pollution of idols, from sexual immorality, from what is strangled, and from blood.",
      "ko": "다만 우상의 더러운 것과 음행과 목매어 죽인 것과 피를 멀리 하라고 편지하는 것이 가하니",
      "source_text_hash": "3390fdd66016b94b7fc1fc6efd4c4ce5e6c24f3e2adb4bf67d634357bbc35001",
      "translation_text_hash": "df45995e59675ec7c335b0a267f8b089fe10782af5718050add4fc0dd539194d",
