      "en": "They wrote these things by their hand: “The apostles, the elders, and the brothers, to the brothers who are of the Gentiles in Antioch, Syria, and Cilicia: greetings.",
      "ko": "그 편에 편지를 부쳐 이르되 사도와 장로된 형제들은 안디옥과 수리아와 길리기아에 있는 이방인 형제들에게 문안하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "58485bf036d72d957ad65ada27a6fcaea305391779a7f632dab2ddd4950e5a60",
      "translation_text_hash": "674a64a40eaf9583f263dee12ad344c7d1a7054cdbe0455c0b1389be3437ea8f",
